===Verb===
'''to [[set]] [[aside]]'''
# {{idiom}}{{transitive}} To [[separate]] and [[reserve]] something for a specific [[purpose]].
#:''Plan to '''set aside''' three or four hours to see the museum.''
# {{idiom}}{{transitive}} To [[disagree]] with something and [[reject]] or [[overturn]] it.
# {{idiom}}{{transitive}} To declare something [[invalid]] or [[null and void]].

